flowchart TD
    A[Source control<br/>agent YAML + Bicep]:::data --> B[CI: lint, validate schema,<br/>golden dataset evaluation]
    B --> C[Deploy to DEV Foundry project<br/>environment-specific deployment names]
    C --> D[Deploy to STAGING<br/>run integration tests]
    D --> E[Canary to PRODUCTION<br/>1-5% of traffic]:::warn
    E --> F[Full PRODUCTION promotion]:::good
    class B focus
    classDef focus fill:#5B4BD6,stroke:#A99BFF,color:#ffffff
    classDef good fill:#1a2a12,stroke:#34d399,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef warn fill:#2a1a22,stroke:#f5b94a,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef risk fill:#2a1a1a,stroke:#fb7185,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef data fill:#162236,stroke:#5ec8f2,color:#e2e8f0
